uted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c1b80b9789ad45721b02ae44e471b0ad.poster.avif?t=1763661956\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c1b80b9789ad45721b02ae44e471b0ad.webm?t=1763661956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/c1b80b9789ad45721b02ae44e471b0ad.mp4?t=1763661956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavies are big, slow brutes that don\u2019t take cover and eat bullets.  You can dump all your ammo into them with no effect.  Run the other way, or find their one weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5-Star Mercenary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These legendary MERX have received the top-tier 5-star rating in the app. They should be approached with caution, and treated as extremely dangerous to you and your team. Intel on these MERX is sketchy, but we know that these endgame encounters will require your team\u2019s full strength to have a chance to take them down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intuitive Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Point is easy to learn, hard to master, perfect for both fresh recruits and seasoned veterans. Crave fast-paced action? How about slow, methodical, skill-driven gameplay? Rogue Point kicks open the door to both those worlds and invites players to choose their own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the currency of combat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your keep on the frontlines to purchase new hardware for your arsenal. Start with nothing more than a pistol and an armored vest, then earn an elite arsenal through successful missions and strategic teamplay. Upgrade your loadout with an assortment of attachments and gear to get out alive. Own the battlefield on your terms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP Teamplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to battle against the MERX threat. Rogue Point is purpose-built to reinforce teamplay and pull players into combat. Plan, Adapt, and Overcome the odds by building your unique Rogue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to buy weapons and gear. Buy the exact loadout you want or put your cash on the line for a chance at rare items only available through the Dead Drop system. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Weapons, with multiple skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Tactical Items and Attachments for your arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ Cosmetic Items, with multiple skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Mission Layouts, across 4 locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.poster.avif?t=1763661956\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.webm?t=1763661956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/extras/186a41394e50f6a0acc11e11c4adac7b.mp4?t=1763661956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul>","developers":["Crowbar Collective"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843840/3fd15fcfb43e9af2d449fdb854f650fc0afa2741/header.jpg?t=1763661956","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Rogue Point \u00a9 Crowbar Collective Inc, published under licence by TEAM17 Digital Limited","linux_requirements":{"min